constraints:
1 ≤ N ≤ 10^{6}
1 ≤ array[i] ≤ 10^{9}
The array may contain duplicates.

expected time complexity: O(N * Log(N))
expected auxiliary space: O(1)

standard_solution_code:
class Solution:

	def smallestpositive(self, arr, n):
		mis = 1
		arr.sort()
		for i in range(n):
			if mis < arr[i]:
				return mis
			else:
				mis += arr[i]
		return mis
